# Root contract for the Vynil project. Project-wide agent operating rules live in
# .specdd/bootstrap.project.md (not a spec). Directory children own their own detail.

Spec: Vynil

Platform: Rust/Kubernetes

Purpose:
  Vynil is a package manager for Kubernetes, in the spirit of dpkg/rpm for the cluster.
  A controller reconciles declarative package installations against declared package
  sources, and drives an in-cluster agent that deploys, updates, backs up, and uninstalls
  applications. Packages are OCI images of Handlebars templates and Rhai scripts.

Structure:
  ./Cargo.toml: Workspace manifest, shared [workspace.lints], cargo-commander aliases
  ./Cargo.lock: Locked dependency graph
  ./rustfmt.toml: Rust formatting configuration
  ./Makefile: Developer entrypoints aliasing cargo cmd
  ./README.md: User-facing overview
  ./mkdocs.yml: Documentation site configuration
  ./llms.txt: AI-readable project index
  ./src/lib.rs: Root `vynil` crate stub (vestigial, not a shipped artifact)
  ./common/common.sdd: Shared typed library crate built on `vynil-core`
  ./agent/agent.sdd: Agent binary and CLI crate
  ./operator/operator.sdd: Reconciling controller crate
  ./server/server.sdd: Diagnostic API server crate
  ./kubectl-vynil/kubectl-vynil.sdd: kubectl plugin crate
  ./box/box.sdd: Shipped `vynil` system package box
  ./deploy/deploy.sdd: CRD and cluster bootstrap manifests
  /.github/workflows/workflows.sdd: Continuous integration pipelines
  ./docs/docs.sdd: User and design documentation
  ./linting.sdd: Static-analysis and formatting harness

Owns:
  ./Cargo.toml
  ./Cargo.lock
  ./Makefile
  ./README.md
  ./mkdocs.yml
  ./requirements-docs.txt
  ./llms.txt
  ./CONTRIBUTORS
  ./LICENSE
  ./TODO.md
  ./src/lib.rs

References:
  ./docs/architecture.md
  ./linting.sdd

Depends on:
  `vynil-core` from crates.io, the reusable Rhai/Handlebars/OCI toolbox

Must:
  Keep the four custom resources `@JukeBox`, `@SystemInstance`, `@ServiceInstance`, and
    `@TenantInstance` in the `vynil.solidite.fr/v1` group as the public API surface.
  Give every product error a stable, unique identifier in its message.
  Keep each crate's build definition, image, CI job, and shipped box consistent with the
    workspace version in `./Cargo.toml`.
  Preserve the dependency direction: `common` depends on `vynil-core`; `agent`, `operator`,
    and `server` depend on `common`; crates never depend back on a binary crate.

Must not:
  Reintroduce the retired `docs/conception/` plus `.tasks/` planning workflow or read it as
    authority.
  Introduce a new workspace crate without a directory-level spec naming its owner.

Done when:
  Every shipped source file has a same-basename spec, and `cargo test`, `cargo clippy
    --all-targets -- -D warnings`, `cargo +nightly fmt --check`, and `specdd lint` are green.

Tasks:
  [x] #0 Install SpecDD and commit the bootstrap and this root spec.
  [x] #1 Stand up the shared static-analysis harness (Cargo.toml lints and per-crate attrs).
  [x] #2 Commit directory-level specs for every crate and shipped artifact.
  [ ] #3 Purge `unwrap()` and `expect()` from product code crate by crate, per each file spec.
  [ ] #4 Draft and review a same-basename spec for every source file, delegated per crate.
  [ ] #5 Remove `.tasks/` and `docs/conception/` remnants and their `.gitignore` entries.
  [ ] #6 Decide the fate of the root `vynil` crate stub in `./src/lib.rs`.
